  "notes": [
    "Pike's short-range +4 applies only on the FIRST combat round; thereafter use its close-range DM.",
    "Each laser hit on Ablat armor reduces that armor's DM by 1 for the remainder of the fight (per-combatant mutable state, not a table constant).",
